## 15. Immediate next build step (engineering)

When you green-light implementation:

1. Create private GitHub repo (or Origin `new_repo` via cloud agent).  
2. Scaffold: `collectors/`, `research/`, `api/`, `web/`, `signer/` (stub), `docs/`.  
3. Seed protocol registry manually after on-chain verification of factory addresses.  
4. Ship Phase 1 dashboard before any execution code paths are reachable in prod configs.

